# Brewfile: installed via `brew bundle --file=host-os/Brewfile`.
# Uncommented = wanted on every machine. Commented = known, but install by hand
# where needed. ./sync.sh offers anything you `brew install` that is not named
# here (commented or not), and records a "keep out" answer as a commented line.

